ts/pull/110\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#110</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fix some bugs with MySQL strict mode <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#111</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed broken sitemap sending <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/112\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#112</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Minor fixes <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/89\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#89</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/94\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#94</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/98\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#98</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/101\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#101</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/103\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#103</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n</ul>Для обновления на версию необходимо выполнить следующие запросы к 